1. What are the main differences between Thread, Runnable, and Callable?

| Concept       | Description                                   | Returns Value? | Throws Exception? |
| ------------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------- |
| `Thread`      | Class that represents a thread                | No             | No                |
| `Runnable`    | Functional interface (run())                  | No             | No                |
| `Callable<V>` | Like Runnable but returns result (`V call()`) | ✅ Yes          | ✅ Yes             |



