2. Explain the difference between synchronized and Lock interface.
| Feature             | synchronized  | Lock                         |
| ------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Reentrant?          | Yes           | Yes (ReentrantLock)          |
| Fairness            | No control    | Can control fairness         |
| Timeout             | Not supported | `tryLock(timeout)` supported |
| Multiple Conditions | No            | Yes via `newCondition()`     |
| Auto-release        | Yes           | Must unlock manually         |


